// Google Maps API key for the iOS Maps SDK (GMSServices).
//
// THIS FILE IS GIT-IGNORED. Never commit a real key.
//
// Create this file locally with your key:
//   echo 'GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY = AIza...' > ios/Flutter/GoogleMapsKey.xcconfig
// or set it in CI by writing the file before `flutter build ios`.
//
// It is included by Debug.xcconfig / Release.xcconfig, flows into
// Info.plist's GMSApiKey via the $(GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY) build setting, and
// AppDelegate.swift reads it with a bundle lookup at launch. When the file
// is absent the build setting is empty and the app runs with Google's own
// "missing key" map state instead of a fake key.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY =
